  "worked_solution": "The equation of the tangent line is\n\n$$\ny=2x+1.\n$$\n\nTo find where the tangent line intersects the $x$-axis, we set $y=0$ and solve for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}0 & =2x+1 \\\\ 2x & =-1 \\\\ x & =\\frac{-1}{2} \\\\ x & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
